' A v1.2 game with Amiga opponents (`preset extended ai amiga seed 7`; 3 before New Village moved the draw), watched from
' Sherwood, where the preset's draw starts the human: he does nothing but
' drink at the spring and end the day, so the opponents' hiring, camps, travel
' and duels are what changes the world. He starves at about day 22; the run
' ends before.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 13,124          ' in
wait 60
